<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>Глава 7. Очереди и стеки on GoToGo</title><link>https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/algorithms/chapter-07/</link><description>Recent content in Глава 7. Очереди и стеки on GoToGo</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><atom:link href="https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/algorithms/chapter-07/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Стеки и очереди</title><link>https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/algorithms/chapter-07/01-basic/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/algorithms/chapter-07/01-basic/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="стек-lifo" class=link_owner>
 Стек (LIFO)
 &lt;a href="#%d1%81%d1%82%d0%b5%d0%ba-lifo" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Last In First Out — последний вошёл, первый вышел. Операции: &lt;code>Push&lt;/code>, &lt;code>Pop&lt;/code>, &lt;code>Peek&lt;/code>.&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">type&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">Stack&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">any&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kd">struct&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">Stack&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">])&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">Push&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">v&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">append&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">v&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">Stack&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">])&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">Len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">Stack&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">])&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">IsEmpty&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">bool&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">==&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">Stack&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">])&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">Pop&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">bool&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">IsEmpty&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kd">var&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">z&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">z&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">false&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">n&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">-&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">v&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">n&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[:&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">n&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">v&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">true&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">Stack&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">])&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">Peek&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">bool&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">IsEmpty&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kd">var&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">z&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">z&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">false&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nb">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">s&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">-&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">],&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">true&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>Применения: история браузера, отмена действий (undo), обход DFS, проверка скобочных выражений.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="очередь-fifo" class=link_owner>
 Очередь (FIFO)
 &lt;a href="#%d0%be%d1%87%d0%b5%d1%80%d0%b5%d0%b4%d1%8c-fifo" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>First In First Out — первый вошёл, первый вышел. Операции: &lt;code>Enqueue&lt;/code>, &lt;code>Dequeue&lt;/code>, &lt;code>Front&lt;/code>.&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">type&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">Queue&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">any&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kd">struct&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">q&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">Queue&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">])&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">Enqueue&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">v&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">q&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">append&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">q&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">v&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">q&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">Queue&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">])&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">Len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">q&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">q&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">Queue&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">])&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">IsEmpty&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">bool&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">q&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">==&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">q&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">Queue&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">])&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">Dequeue&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">bool&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">q&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nf">IsEmpty&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kd">var&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">z&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">z&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">false&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">v&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">:=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">q&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">q&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">q&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="mi">1&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// O(n) — сдвиг; для O(1) нужен кольцевой буфер&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">v&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">true&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>Применения: очереди задач, обход BFS, буферизация потоков.&lt;/p></description></item><item><title>Кольцевой буфер</title><link>https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/algorithms/chapter-07/02-ring-buffer/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://gotogolang.github.io/dojo/algorithms/chapter-07/02-ring-buffer/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="идея" class=link_owner>
 Идея
 &lt;a href="#%d0%b8%d0%b4%d0%b5%d1%8f" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>Кольцевой (циклический) буфер — массив фиксированного размера с двумя указателями: &lt;code>head&lt;/code> (читаем) и &lt;code>tail&lt;/code> (пишем). При достижении конца массива указатель «оборачивается» на начало.&lt;/p>
&lt;pre tabindex="0">&lt;code>┌───┬───┬───┬───┬───┐
│ │ 2 │ 3 │ 4 │ │
└───┴───┴───┴───┴───┘
 ↑ head ↑ tail
&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;p>Даёт &lt;code>O(1)&lt;/code> для &lt;code>Enqueue&lt;/code> и &lt;code>Dequeue&lt;/code> без аллокаций.&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="реализация" class=link_owner>
 Реализация
 &lt;a href="#%d1%80%d0%b5%d0%b0%d0%bb%d0%b8%d0%b7%d0%b0%d1%86%d0%b8%d1%8f" class="link icon">
 &lt;svg>
 &lt;use xlink:href="#anchor-link">&lt;/use>
 &lt;/svg>
 &lt;/a>
&lt;/h2>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-go" data-lang="go">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">type&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">RingBuffer&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">any&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kd">struct&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">head&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">tail&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">size&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">cap&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">NewRingBuffer&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">any&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">](&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">cap&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">RingBuffer&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;amp;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">RingBuffer&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]{&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">data&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">make&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">([]&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">cap&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">),&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">cap&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">cap&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kd">func&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">r&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">RingBuffer&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">])&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">Enqueue&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">v&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">T&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">bool&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">r&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">size&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">==&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">r&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">cap&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">return&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">false&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span> &lt;span class="c1">// переполнен&lt;/span>
